541 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (CAMPAIGN BASE PROMPT\r\nLuxury summer jewelry campaign featuring the same adult female model throughout the entire series.\r Mid-20s woman with light warm skin, blue-green eyes, medium brown hair wet and naturally slicked backward, strong natural eyebrows, subtle freckles, natural lips and minimal no-makeup makeup.\r She wears the exact same oversized sculptural gold five-petal flower earrings with finely textured metallic petals and a detailed gold center.\r Minimal taupe swimwear.\r \rThe campaign takes place around a modern Mediterranean luxury villa swimming pool with turquoise water, warm white limestone and smooth white architectural concrete.\r Bright cloudless summer day with strong Mediterranean sunlight, realistic specular highlights on wet skin and naturally scattered water droplets.\r High-end European jewelry editorial photographed with an analogue-inspired medium-format aesthetic.\r Visible skin pores, peach fuzz, freckles, subtle blemishes, slight uneven skin tone, fine facial texture and individual wet hair strands.\r Natural facial asymmetry. No beauty retouching. No airbrushed or plastic skin.\r \rSubtle film grain, restrained contrast, natural highlight clipping, minor lens imperfections and realistic optical softness.\r No HDR. No CGI appearance. No overly polished commercial rendering.\r)
/K [2]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 542 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
>>
endobj
